---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | TMG Plumbing & Heating"
  description="Privacy policy for TMG Plumbing & Heating Services."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 space-y-6 text-navy/80 leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-medium text-navy mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-navy/50 text-sm">
      Placeholder — replace with TMG's actual privacy policy text before
      launch. Must cover: what data is collected via the quote form and
      cookies, how it's used and stored, third parties it's shared with
      (e.g. the form backend, GA4, Stripe on the pay page), and how a
      person can request access to or deletion of their data under GDPR.
    </p>
    <p>
      TMG Plumbing & Heating Services ("we", "us") is committed to
      protecting your privacy. This policy explains what personal data we
      collect, how we use it, and your rights under applicable data
      protection law.
    </p>
    <p>
      For any questions about this policy or your personal data, contact us
      at <a href="mailto:info@tmgplumbing.ie" class="text-orange">info@tmgplumbing.ie</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
